  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the olive oil, garlic, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the mixture evenly onto each piece of flatbread.",
    "Sprinkle the shredded smoked mozzarella cheese over the flatbread.",
    "Bake the flatbread in the preheated oven for 10-12 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove the flatbread from the oven and sprinkle with chopped fresh parsley if desired.",
    "Let the flatbread cool for a few minutes before slicing and serving.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy."
